# Fallback optimiser for a 24 GB card: DeepSeek-Coder-V2 16B (MoE, 2.4B active), 8.9 GB at Q4; MLA keeps
# its KV cache small (~1 GB per 32k slot). Proven in this harness on AFlow, MIPRO and bilevel (runs_smoke_v2/v3).
# Same model as the laptop Modelfile.deepseek-coder-v2-16b-8k, without the num_gpu limit and with 32k context.
FROM deepseek-coder-v2:16b
PARAMETER num_ctx 32768
# num_thread 4: llama.cpp otherwise spins one CPU thread per core the machine advertises, and under a
# container CPU quota that spinning stalls every step (H100 box, 2026-11-05: 2.5x slower per call,
# no gain from parallel slots). The GPU does the work; 4 threads are plenty for the CPU side.
PARAMETER num_thread 4
